## Magit, Org mode, and Helm

Macros includes features named after — and modeled on — the well-known GNU Emacs
packages **Magit**, **Org mode**, and **Helm**. These are
**original reimplementations written in Scheme** on Macros' own editor
primitives; **no source code from those Emacs packages is copied or included**.
They therefore carry no separate license — like the rest of Macros they are
covered by the MIT License. They are named here only to credit the projects
that inspired them.

